WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.150
What happens to a stuffed penguin&nbsp;
when it is run through SCP-914?

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:09.070
Doctor Ravensworth selected a stuffed animal&nbsp;
in the shape of a penguin, a copy of Dr.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:14.350
Ravensworth's "Tesla's Adventures," - a book&nbsp;
about a penguin exploring the universe - and one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:19.390
hundred grams of metal. The items were all placed&nbsp;
into the Clockworks on the setting "Very Fine."

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:23.770
The output produced was a small clockwork&nbsp;
metal penguin, which immediately attacked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:28.030
Dr. Ravensworth as soon as the door was&nbsp;
opened. The attacks were not effective,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.430
due to the penguin's size and limited mobility.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:34.690
Dr Ravensworth noted, “That did not&nbsp;
go as well as I thought it would.”

